Before research: recover context via `/speckit:resume` (`handover.md -> _memory.continuity -> spec docs`). During each iteration: write `iterations/iteration-NNN.md`, record one JSON event record through the append gateway, let the reducer refresh strategy/registry/dashboard. After research: save continuity via `generate-context.js`.

