.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:35:This protocol does not own the shared intake contract in `.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/workflows/intake-contract.md`, nor `/speckit:plan` or `/speckit:complete` delegation behavior.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:38:The workflow remains four-phase:
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:53:- Ownership: acquired by the deep-research workflow, not by the leaf agent
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:73:- Release records whether the workflow ended with save, skip-save, or cancellation cleanup.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:99:- The workflow records a typed `spec_check_result` audit event before any mutation branch executes.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:138:The workflow writes or replaces exactly one machine-owned fence nested under the chosen host anchor:
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:149:- The workflow replaces the full block atomically when content changes.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:155:- The workflow must not create duplicate generated blocks in sibling sections.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:163:Each spec-protocol row a workflow writes keeps its legacy shape. The append gateway accepts it and stores it as a typed ledger event under one of seven stems: `deep_research.spec_check_result`, `deep_research.spec_seed_created`, `deep_research.spec_preinit_context_added`, `deep_research.spec_preinit_context_deduped`, `deep_research.spec_mutation`, `deep_research.spec_mutation_conflict`, and `deep_research.spec_synthesis_deferred`. The gateway upcasts the row into that stem's payload, and the state log shows the row as written, with the append time as its timestamp.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/references/protocol/spec-check-protocol.md:194:- The shared intake contract (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/workflows/intake-contract.md` §5-§6) applies the same normalization before writing `feature_description` into `spec.md` Problem Statement or Purpose; equivalent normalized phrases emit `intake_topic_deduped` instead of overwriting the existing prose.
