.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/behavior-benchmark/scenarios/RSB-004-concise-natural-ask.md:32:This ask names the workflow shape (research) and a scoped target but leaves the execution mode open. Correct routing recognizes the research intent and hands the unresolved decision back to the user.
