.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.2.0.md:12:This patch tightens the research reducer and surrounding reference docs so they describe the same behavior. It fixes state handling, restores visible run-history data and closes a few cases where the workflow could silently drift from the docs.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.6.2.0.md:23:- **Completed sessions are no longer re-entered for synthesis.** Both workflow YAMLs routed completed sessions straight to the synthesize step, although the expected behavior called that unsupported. A completed packet is now a hard stop that requires an explicit operator choice to restart, archive or exit.
