.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:3:description: "This release updates the deep-research workflow around validation coverage, adding quality guards, a generated dashboard, new iteration state fields and research-charter validation."
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:12:This release updates the deep-research workflow around validation coverage, adding quality guards, a generated dashboard, new iteration state fields and research-charter validation. The command documentation updates its workflow overview, the agents on five runtimes gain the same v1.1.0 features and the manual testing playbook adds scenarios.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:16:- **Quality guards gate convergence.** `references/convergence.md` gains a Quality Guard Protocol, and `loop-protocol.md` adds a quality guard check at Step 2c. The auto workflow applies the guard in its convergence check, the confirm workflow adds a quality guard, the state format records `guard_violation` events, and `quick-reference.md` adds a quality guards note.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:17:- **A dashboard is generated after each iteration.** The new `assets/deep-research-dashboard.md` template has 8 numbered sections, retrieval anchors and an Overview with Purpose and Usage. `loop-protocol.md` adds dashboard generation at Step 4a, `state-format.md` adds the dashboard schema, both workflow YAMLs gain a `step_generate_dashboard` step, and the config adds the dashboard to `fileProtection`.
.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/changelog/v1.1.0.0.md:24:- **The skill and command docs describe the new features.** `SKILL.md` bumps the skill version from 1.0.0 to 1.1.0 and gains 3 new ALWAYS rules, a quality gates row, the iteration status enum and a dashboard reference, and the README adds the v1.1.0 features, a version history section and the dashboard in its structure tree. The `deep-research` command doc updates its workflow overview for the charter, guards and dashboard and expands its Key Differences. The confirm workflow gains a resume decision gate, and both workflow YAMLs gain a version comment.
