.skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/feature-catalog/state-management/question-conflict-ownership.md:29:The workflow surfaces those disagreements through `question_conflict` JSONL events. Supported operator decisions are `accepted`, `rejected`, `superseded`, and `needs_decision`; unresolved conflicts default to `needs_decision` so the loop does not silently choose a winner.
